<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.90 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.90 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office  SUVL:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.90 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  102.35</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,482 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 2,517 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 2.46 billion markka at a price of 99.70 and a yield of 7.29 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 14.019 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
